Shame, really.

120
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:11,840
Maybe they'll be line dancing.

121
00:07:11,840 --> 00:07:13,840
I hope not.

122
00:07:13,840 --> 00:07:17,840
Well, this is as close as we can get to the horses. They don't like us.

123
00:07:17,840 --> 00:07:22,840
Well, looking back, it's LA. They're like a block from the comedy store.

124
00:07:22,840 --> 00:07:24,840
Van Nijs.

125
00:07:24,840 --> 00:07:26,840
The big valley!

126
00:07:26,840 --> 00:07:30,840
Joe dropped the needle. Now he's off eating a mellow cup.

127
00:07:30,840 --> 00:07:34,840
Squeaky, we gotta leave. Come on.

128
