133
00:07:53,840 --> 00:07:56,840
But that vein of water must still be here on the ground.

134
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,840
She'll find it, if it's here.

135
00:07:58,840 --> 00:08:00,840
Yeah, she'll find it.

136
00:08:00,840 --> 00:08:02,840
She can find more than water.

137
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:06,840
You remember last spring, she found my wedding ring. I lost in the mulberry patch.

138
00:08:06,840 --> 00:08:09,840
The King's Man Approacheth.

139
00:08:09,840 --> 00:08:13,840
This is an early version of the Milagro Beanfield War.

140
00:08:13,840 --> 00:08:18,840
Why can't I just bend spoons with my mind like everyone else?

141
