They stepped in something.

161
00:09:13,840 --> 00:09:16,840
No use today, Aunt Flavia. I'm just too nervous.

162
00:09:16,840 --> 00:09:18,840
But, dear, you were so sure you'd find water.

163
00:09:18,840 --> 00:09:21,840
Yeah, they're all dumb as post and they home-schooled her.

164
00:09:21,840 --> 00:09:24,840
Not when I can feel people doubting me.

165
00:09:24,840 --> 00:09:26,840
Have a nice ride, Mr. Hawthorne.

166
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:27,840
Wonderful.

167
00:09:27,840 --> 00:09:29,840
Can I interest you in some insurance?

168
00:09:29,840 --> 00:09:32,840
