174
00:09:38,840 --> 00:09:40,840
Oh, you're wrong, Jessica. It really is.

175
00:09:40,840 --> 00:09:41,840
It's not.

176
00:09:41,840 --> 00:09:43,840
It's hard science.

177
00:09:43,840 --> 00:09:44,840
I'll show you.

178
00:09:44,840 --> 00:09:46,840
Guy's smoking a field mouse.

179
00:09:46,840 --> 00:09:48,840
Jesus.

180
00:09:48,840 --> 00:09:51,840
Ma'am, do we have crops to get in or horses to feed?

181
00:09:51,840 --> 00:09:55,840
Maybe those irrigation lines like we were talking about.

182
00:09:55,840 --> 00:09:57,840
Ma'am.

183
00:09:57,840 --> 00:10:01,840
Here comes the bride. She's out of her friggin' mind.

184
00:10:03,840 --> 00:10:06,840
Na-na-na-na. Mess it up. Mess it up.

185
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:11,840
What do I do now? How do I get myself into this stuff?

186
00:10:11,840 --> 00:10:14,840
Come on, you stupid stick divine.

187
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:19,840
Oh, he needs batteries.

188
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:22,840
Water. She's found water. Hooray!

189
00:10:22,840 --> 00:10:24,840
Boy, go stake that spot.

190
00:10:24,840 --> 00:10:26,840
Come on, Mike.

191
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:28,840
Doubt my ass, science boy.

192
00:10:28,840 --> 00:10:30,840
You saw that, Gordon?

193
00:10:30,840 --> 00:10:34,840
I don't mean an empiricist, but I need to see the water.

194
00:10:34,840 --> 00:10:39,840
You're my favorite sister, daughter.

195
00:10:39,840 --> 00:10:41,840
Good girl.

196
00:10:41,840 --> 00:10:44,840
Right here. Here's where I feel it's strongest.

197
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,840
Gonna see Miss Eliza.

198
00:10:46,840 --> 00:10:48,840
Go to Mississippi.

199
00:10:48,840 --> 00:10:50,840
No, don't.

200
00:10:50,840 --> 00:10:53,840
What's wrong, Jessica? Don't dig here.

201
00:10:53,840 --> 00:10:56,840
Please don't. There's something evil down there.

202
00:10:56,840 --> 00:10:58,840
Maybe it's gold. The root of all evil.

203
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:00,840
Come on, start digging.

204
00:11:00,840 --> 00:11:02,840
No, it's not gold. Leave it alone.

205
00:11:02,840 --> 00:11:05,840
May I remark that superstition also leads to delusion?

206
00:11:05,840 --> 00:11:07,840
I'm not having delusion.

207
00:11:07,840 --> 00:11:09,840
There's nothing evil about digging a hole.

208
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:11,840
Yes, there is. Get to work, Boyd.

209
00:11:11,840 --> 00:11:13,840
Okay. All right, Mike.

210
00:11:13,840 --> 00:11:15,840
You wanna see Miss Eliza?

211
00:11:15,840 --> 00:11:18,840
You're all horrible. I hope you all die.

212
00:11:18,840 --> 00:11:21,840
