213
00:11:21,840 --> 00:11:25,840
Kidget. Have you lain with a hornet one again?

214
00:11:25,840 --> 00:11:27,840
Linda.

215
00:11:27,840 --> 00:11:30,840
I hope it rises and falls on you again.

216
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,840
Let's get her to the cabin.

217
00:11:32,840 --> 00:11:35,840
It's like Carmine from Laverne and Shirley.

218
00:11:35,840 --> 00:11:38,840
Her butt is under a big w.

219
