Go on.

220
00:11:40,840 --> 00:11:43,840
Too bad this tree was our state forest.

221
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:47,840
You're all evil, and I hope you all have snacks.

222
00:11:47,840 --> 00:11:49,840
See?

223
00:11:49,840 --> 00:11:52,840
All I have power over the trees, that's nice to know.

224
00:11:52,840 --> 00:11:54,840
Are you sure you're all right, Linda?

225
00:11:54,840 --> 00:11:56,840
