00:12:08,840 --> 00:12:10,840
But Jessica, it wasn't your fault.

232
00:12:10,840 --> 00:12:12,840
It was. You heard what I said.

233
00:12:12,840 --> 00:12:14,840
Honestly.

234
00:12:14,840 --> 00:12:16,840
Think of something.

235
00:12:16,840 --> 00:12:18,840
I can't think you had anything to do with that.

236
00:12:18,840 --> 00:12:20,840
But I did. It was an evil wish.

237
00:12:20,840 --> 00:12:22,840
An evil is very strong.

238
00:12:22,840 --> 00:12:24,840
Oaky beatniks.

239
00:12:24,840 --> 00:12:26,840
Jessica, it was pure coincidence.

240
00:12:26,840 --> 00:12:28,840
A strong gust of wind came and a...

241
00:12:28,840 --> 00:12:30,840
An evil wish.

242
00:12:30,840 --> 00:12:33,840
Who's for evil lunch before I take an evil nap?

243
00:12:33,840 --> 00:12:36,840
I'll never use the witching wand again.

244
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:38,840
I'm all through with that kind of thing.

245
00:12:38,840 --> 00:12:40,840
So interesting, though.

246
00:12:40,840 --> 00:12:42,840
I think it swings.

247
00:12:42,840 --> 00:12:45,840
When did you first discover that you were a water witch?

248
00:12:45,840 --> 00:12:48,840
There's something Arch Hall Junior about her.

249
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:50,840
Always.

250
00:12:50,840 --> 00:12:52,840
Have a seat, Cindy.

251
00:12:52,840 --> 00:12:54,840
I've been able to find things.

252
00:12:54,840 --> 00:12:56,840
Like once I found this rubber band.

253
00:12:56,840 --> 00:12:58,840
It's right for me to find that, is it?

254
